  "system": {
    "description": "<p>The caster tests Will + {{math spellPower \"*\" 2}} against the target's Strength or Dexterity.</p><p><strong>On success:</strong> the target is knocked Prone and pushed back one hex.</p><p><strong>On failure:</strong> the target is pushed back one hex.</p><p><strong>On failure by a margin of 50 or more:</strong> the target is not pushed at all.</p><p>A successful cast cancels the incoming physical attack. Can be cast as a Reaction only when the caster is attacked.</p>",
